<title>CANADA: Canada's Odyssey says Oman well abandoned.</title>
<headline>Canada's Odyssey says Oman well abandoned.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Odyssey Petroleum Corp said on Thursday it abandoned its Wadi Saylah No. 1 well in Oman after tests revealed non-commercial quantities of oil.</p>
</text>
